  "category" : "crafting",
  "level" : 6, "race" : "alta",

  "shortdescription" : "^orange;Alta Energy Station^reset;",
  "description" : "An ^#b0e0fc;alta^reset; energy technology workshop for crafting ^#60c0fc;energy tools^reset;, ^#60c0fc;wiring^reset;, and electronic devices.",
  "longdescription" : "The Alta Energy Station is a tier 6 comprehensive energy systems workshop dedicated to electrical and electronic fabrication. This advanced station produces ^#60c0fc;energy tools^reset; (what altas call weapons - energy projectors, plasma emitters, ionic disruptors), ^#60c0fc;wiring components^reset; for circuit construction, electronic ^#60c0fc;augments^reset; for equipment enhancement, and various ^#60c0fc;small energy devices^reset; like scanners and tools. It features energy cell assembly equipment, circuit board fabrication systems, and ^#60c0fc;calotronics^reset; (crystal-based electronics) integration tools. The station represents alta mastery over electrical engineering and energy manipulation.",
  "altaDescription" : "My energy workshop! This is where we build energy tools (the scientific term for weapons), wiring, augments, and all sorts of electronic devices~",

  "apexDescription" : "Alta energy systems workshop. Their circuit design methodology differs interestingly from ours.",
  "avianDescription" : "A workshop for energy devices and electric tools! Lightning harnessed for creation.",
  "floranDescription" : "Makesss energy weaponsss and wiring thingsss. Floran likesss sharp better but energy good.",
  "glitchDescription" : "Intrigued. Their terminology 'energy tools' for weapons reveals their scientific perspective.",
  "humanDescription" : "Electronics workshop! Energy weapons, wiring, augments - all the electrical stuff.",
  "hylotlDescription" : "A station honoring the flow of energy. The alta understand electricity as a natural force to guide.",
  "novakidDescription" : "Energy device maker! All sorts of electrical gadgets, weapons, and wirin' components.",

  "inventoryIcon" : "icon.png",
